{"overview":"در جهانی که توسط یک فاجعه ویرانگر به‌هم‌ریخته، یک جوان زمین‌پذیر کشف می‌کند که او آواتار جدید پس از کورراست. اما در این دوران خطرناک، این عنوان او را به‌جای نجات‌بخش، نابودگر بشریت می‌سازد. او توسط دشمنان انسانی و روحی تعقیب می‌شود؛ او و دوقلوی گمشده‌اش باید ریشه‌های مرموز خود را کشف کنند و هفت پناهگاه را نجات دهند پیش از آنکه آخرین استحکامات تمدن فرو بریزد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"In a world shattered by a devastating cataclysm, a young Earthbender discovers she's the new Avatar after Korra. But in this dangerous era, that title marks her as humanity's destroyer, not its savior. Hunted by both human and spirit enemies, she and her long-lost twin must uncover their mysterious origins and save the Seven Havens before civilization's last strongholds collapse.","tagline_en":"New legends will rise.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":13,"y":2026,"poster":"/oY0G5eVUxN1bm1ci6nau4VkdPcY.jpg"}],"episodes":13,"crew":["مایکل دانته دی‌مارتینو","برایان کونیتزکو"],"crew_en":["Michael Dante DiMartino","Bryan Konietzko"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"Saheli Khan","role":"Pavi (voice)","photo":"/v7KEBCh275MWmT0j5fxm4fslosD.jpg"},{"name":"Aishwarya 'Aishu' Devan","role":"Nisha (voice)","photo":"/eRDnTa8yKo0G79j7Z48jeNODRuj.jpg"},{"name":"Major Curda","role":"Jae (voice)","photo":"/oHkyajLazp64ttgStLcJTY4wTvU.jpg"},{"name":"Akshay Khanna","role":"Karthik (voice)","photo":"/L2JWyOTwPRLHBLV7xUmDOcRHU3.jpg"},{"name":"سکینه جعفری","role":"Agam (voice)","photo":"/9U6vixMcwkj8aEffy64UqsklHd.jpg","en":"Sakina Jaffrey"}],"trailer":"nhdh962_ee0","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/284833-avatar-seven-havens/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Paramount Plus Premium","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/4N4BMd0Mm0kHAmF7RZgL5lW3cwc.png"},{"n":"Paramount Plus Essential","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uPWQPyF4nqwtfPNmGcFcenU57HG.png"},{"n":"Paramount Plus Apple TV channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/xu4LyKTwasTbta1Z0qWtZG48yZ3.png"}